 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED, for the reason button.css states in full: every
 * `rottay-*` layer sorts before Tailwind's `base` layer, so a layered rule
 * loses to preflight regardless of specificity (P-47). Unlayered outranks
 * preflight + DaisyUI and still yields to a caller's inline `style`.
 *
 * SCOPE ROOT is the panel's outer `<div>`, which carries the pair
 * `ds-pattern-filter-panel ds-engine-modern`; every painted element is a
 * descendant with a `data-part`. The engine has two roots — the main panel and
 * the loading early-return — and both carry the class pair + `data-part='root'`.
