 * could take, exactly as the inline style did. Card sets border-WIDTH/STYLE via
 * its variant; this rule overrides only border-COLOR, matching the inline
 * `borderColor` it replaces. The `--selected` modifier repeats the same way and
 * follows the base rule so it wins the conditional border-color/box-shadow.
 *
 * MOBILE STATE PANEL: the loading and empty panels share `data-part=
 * 'mobile-state-panel'` and carry byte-identical values (verified); one rule.
 *
 * Values are transcribed verbatim from cell-editors/index.tsx,
 * DataTableMobileCards.tsx and PatternDataTable.tsx.
