/**
 * Rustic PasswordInput skin (WO-SKIN-02 checkpoint A, fields batch).
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED, same rationale as every other engine skin (P-47).
 *
 * SCOPE ROOT is `.ds-password-input.ds-password-input--rustic[data-part='root']`,
