 *
 * SCOPE ROOTS: `Upload` and `Dragger` are two separate top-level components in
 * `engines/modern.tsx`, each with its OWN root `<div data-part='root'>`. Neither
 * root carried a first-party class before this migration -- unlike every other
 * migrated modern-engine component, `className` on both roots was previously
 * caller-only passthrough. This migration adds `ds-upload`/`ds-upload--modern`
 * (Upload) and `ds-upload-dragger`/`ds-upload-dragger--modern` (Dragger),
 * mirroring the `.ds-<comp>.ds-<comp>--modern` convention every sibling skin
 * uses and the BEM pair (`rottay-upload`/`rottay-upload-dragger`) the rustic
 * engine already carried -- without this, no rule below could be scoped to
 * this component without leaking onto any other component that reuses the same
 * generic `data-part` values (`root`, `file-list`, ...) elsewhere on the page.
