 * handlers and shipping a rest border rule here restores the real default.
 * (2) the item-row hover's `#1677ff` hex fallback and the move-button
 * hover/press shadows were magic literals duplicated inline; they are
 * transcribed byte-exact below (still not tokenized -- filed as a proposal).
