/* ---- backdrop: runtime scrim + opt-in blur, both via hatches stamped inline.
        An unset filter hatch falls back to `none`, reproducing the omitted-key
        behavior of `blurBackdrop: false`. The hatches are `--ds-modal-scrim-*`,
