 * base layer, so a layered rule loses to preflight regardless of specificity.
 * Unlayered outranks preflight and still yields to a caller's inline `style`.
 *
 * SPECIFICITY (P-48): every rule painting a border COLOR reaches b >= 4 to clear
 * the tenant artifacts' unlayered `html[data-tenant]:not([data-theme]):not(.light) *`
 * border-color floor at (0,3,1). `border: none` on the OK and close buttons is a
