/**
 * Modern Popover skin (WO-SKIN-04 checkpoint P).
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47): every `@layer rottay-*` sorts before Tailwind's
 * base layer, so a layered rule cannot paint these elements at all.
 *
 * SCOPE IS `rottay-popover--modern`, NEVER `ds-popover` (P3). personality.css carries
