 * which is DORMANT: neither engine carries any of those three classnames, and neither
 * has ANY entrance animation today (no `<style>`, no `@keyframes`, no `transition`
 * anywhere in either file). Naming this scope class `ds-popover` would wake that rule
 * and hand Popover an entrance animation it has never had — a visual change disguised
 * as a naming choice. The same trap exists for `.ds-dropdown` and Dropdown.
