 * SPECIFICITY (P-48): non-border paint beats preflight unlayered at (0,3,0)+.
 * Values transcribed verbatim from `engines/modern.tsx`.
 */

/* ---- root surface: per-tone tinted background + matching text color. The
        unqualified rule carries the info values because the lookup it replaces
