/**
 * Modern Divider skin (WO-SKIN-05 checkpoint L).
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47): every `rottay-*` layer sorts before
 * Tailwind's `base` layer, so a layered rule loses to preflight regardless
 * of specificity. Unlayered outranks preflight and still yields to a
 * caller's inline `style`.
 *
 * SCOPE ROOT mints `rottay-divider rottay-divider--modern` (grep-verified
