 * L.2 (checked live, refuted): the with-text root's own border channel is
 * NOT reproduced here. `theme.css`'s `.divider-horizontal`/`.divider-vertical`
 * bridge is zeroed by Tailwind's preflight before it ever paints (measured
 * `border-top-width: 0px` live, production build, CDP), and this
 * component's with-text root never set a border inline either. The real
 * line paint lives on the `line-before`/`line-after` children (with-text
 * case) or merges onto the root itself (plain divider,
 * `data-with-text='false'`) -- explicitly gated below so the with-text root
 * never receives it.
