/**
 * Rustic Divider skin (WO-SKIN-05 checkpoint L).
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47), same rationale as every other engine skin:
 * a layered rule loses to Tailwind's `base` layer regardless of
 * specificity; unlayered outranks preflight and still yields to a caller's
