 * treatment at all -- unlike modern's imperative brighten-on-hover. This is a
 * real, pre-existing engine asymmetry; no `:hover` rule is added here to match it.
 *
 * Values transcribed verbatim from `engines/rustic.tsx`. Two hardcoded literals
 * (not tokens) are transcribed as-is: badgeStyle's `borderRadius: 8` (-> 8px)
