 *
 * SPECIFICITY (P-48): root and filter both paint a border COLOR and have no
 * second contract attribute to spend, so both reach (0,4,0) by repeating their
 * own `data-part` (two root classes (0,2,0) + `data-part` x2 (0,2,0)). The dot
 * and badge backgrounds are non-border paint and win unlayered at (0,3,0).
