 * Engine-agnostic: every export renders one tree under every engine.
 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED. Every tenant layer sorts before Tailwind preflight;
 * an unlayered skin keeps component paint above that reset while leaving
 * caller inline overrides in charge.
 *
